---
description: Money, stock, and sale invariants that must not be broken
globs: backend/**/*.{js,mjs}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Invariants

- Round money with `round2` / `sumMoney` from `utils/money.js`. Weighed KG POS lines: `roundScaleSaleTotal`.
- POS sale tax is always **0** (`utils/tax.js`). Purchase invoices may have VAT.
- Stock truth is `inventory_ledger`. Update `products.stock` only as an atomic cache. Negative stock is allowed.
- Historical profit: `transaction_items.unit_cost_at_sale` — never live `products.cost`.
- Completed `transactions` are immutable. Refunds only. Checkout needs `idempotency_key`.
- Multi-row money/stock writes go through `withTransaction` (`utils/dbTx.js`).
- Schema changes: `database/init.js` only. Do not execute `migrations/archive/`.
- `products.sku` is not a barcode. Operational `store_id` is `1`.
